+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+No decision on plain HTTP for internal hosts is currently recorded for this project, so this document sets no policy either way. The only trace in the project's history is an unconfirmed remark from a past session that favoured HTTPS everywhere with no exceptions. It was never recorded as a decision, so it is not treated as one. A decision needs to be recorded before this document states a rule.
